-- Blasted Lands (zone 4): doubled wildlife and camp spawns (section F, Part A of R\tmp\S6\S6_spawns_draft.sql).
-- Sourced: the counts. mop had 65 Ashmane Boars, 43 Snickerfang Hyenas and 40 Redstone Basilisks in the zone where both TDBs
--   (one witness: the 4.4.2 box is inside the 12.1.0 box) have 33 / 25 / 24, and the extra ones stand next to a twin of the
--   same entry (boar 32 of 65, hyena 27 of 43, basilisk 22 of 40 under 15 yd from one).
-- Ours: the thinning rule and which twin of a pair stays (as the Swamp of Sorrows pass): same-entry spawns closer than 15 yd
--   form a cluster; it keeps the spawns that have a TDB spawn of the entry within 40 yd (nearest first), or one; camp soldiers and the Serpent's Coil cultists lose
--   only same-entry stacks under 1 yd (1.5 yd in the Coil).
-- Quest densities after this file (S6 table 3.2): boar 46, hyena 28, basilisk 28, felhound 31, Dreadmaul Ambusher 7, Mauler 18,
--   Darktail Bonepicker 39, Drowned Gilnean Merchant 17 / Sailor 18, Shadowsworn Occultist 18 / Spellblade 17, Bloodwash
--   Enchantress 17 / Barbarian 25 / Acolyte 16, Okril'lon Scout 19, Felspore Bog Lord 12.
-- Ours: at TDB spot 301461 the draft kept the idle Dreadmaul Ambusher 164512 and deleted 164495, whose 4-point path ends on that
--   spot; this file keeps the walker ("they just WALK IN", 41136 comment 2011-02-18 [+5]) and deletes 164512.
-- Not here: the Nethergarde Mines, the Rockpool summon layer, the Shadowsworn Obstructors, Loramus' Body, the static Gilnean
--   spirits (other sections). Dependents: addons, the 17 waypoint paths these spawns own (no other spawn or template
--   uses them), pools, events, formations, links, guid SmartAI.

